  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who may be drawn to or share content that trivializes or mocks historical trauma, particularly Holocaust-related imagery, by framing it as a visual novelty (e.g., 'colorized' photos). This includes those who may hold antisemitic views or are indifferent to the gravity of genocide, as the meme's hateful intent relies on minimizing the suffering of Jewish victims through aesthetic manipulation and historical inaccuracy. The audience may also include those who find humor or entertainment in altering historical photographs, potentially reinforcing antisemitic tropes by reducing victims to a 'colorized' subject.",
